ng features, ensuring an enriching journey for users of all backgrounds and interests. From diverse categories spanning mathematics, science, IT, languages, arts, music, sports, economics, politics, and beyond, to flexible difficulty levels and engaging modes like Survival, Riddles, 2/4 Images, Special, and Multiplayer, Babi offers a dynamic and immersive learning environment. Specialized modes such as Comics, Social Networks, Mangas, Animation, and more cater to niche interests, while the inclusion of jokers, bonuses, and questions in picture format add layers of excitement and interactivity. With both online and local modes available, users can delve into quizzes at their own pace, supported by comprehensive statistics tracking their progress. \n\\n\\n\nBabi Quiz stands as the epitome of accessible and enriching education, free of charge, offering a delightful blend of entertainment and learning for all.","location":"Toulouse, France","site":"https://youtu.be/R3I7OnMZQmM","technologies":"React Native, Typescript, Google Firebase"}}],"showcase":[{"fields":{"title":"ac4","description":"","file":{"url":"//videos.ctfassets.net/9fbmaqn9d9lb/3rEOytMnr5EcR7AqeIwcic/b0982ff05ffd97d04d317e98437efd03/4.mp4","details":{"size":3503558},"fileName":"4.mp4","contentType":"video/mp4"}}},{"fields":{"title":"ENAC Unity landscape","description":"","file":{"url":"//images.ctfassets.net/9fbmaqn9d9lb/2HBZ3wh1cBO1VtaXtQQPQ7/98ca5479673a390b4035090805bc3432/May_23_Screenshot_from_CompressPNG.png","details":{"size":49460,"image":{"width":1488,"height":878}},"fileName":"May 23 Screenshot from CompressPNG.png","contentType":"image/png"}}},{"fields":{"title":"UCOLIS showcase 2","description":"","file":{"url":"//images.ctfassets.net/9fbmaqn9d9lb/10tk4a7KbfzWQdYDpp7LR2/c4bd8098f1671a67a2a6a082c1521bd9/Example_07_Min.png","details":{"size":66396,"image":{"width":1440,"height":1024}},"fileName":"Example 07 Min.png","contentType":"image/png"}}},{"fields":{"title":"Babi quiz video 2","description"